_1977/1978\" title=\"Europeiska cupvinnarcupen i fotboll 1977/1978\">Cupvinnarcupen</a></th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96sters_IF\" title=\"Östers IF\">Östers IF</a></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;background-color:#f0f1f2;\">Statistik</th></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Bästa målgörare</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rutger_Backe\" title=\"Rutger Backe\">Rutger Backe</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Halmstads_BK\" title=\"Halmstads BK\">Halmstads BK</a> (21)</td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Största&#160;hemmavinst</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/IFK_Sundsvall\" title=\"IFK Sundsvall\">IFK Sundsvall</a> 9–2 <a href=\"/wiki/Kalmar_FF\" title=\"Kalmar FF\">Kalmar</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(20 juni 1976)</span></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Största&#160;bortavinst</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kalmar_FF\" title=\"Kalmar FF\">Kalmar</a> 1–5 <a href=\"/wiki/Halmstads_BK\" title=\"Halmstads BK\">Halmstad</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(15 augusti 1976)</span></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Målrikaste match</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/IFK_Sundsvall\" title=\"IFK Sundsvall\">IFK Sundsvall</a> 9–2 <a href=\"/wiki/Kalmar_FF\" title=\"Kalmar FF\">Kalmar</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(20 juni 1976)</span></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Åskådarantal i snitt</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><span style=\"display:none\">&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;06946.&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;0</span>6&#160;946<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class